Shannon Lee: Yeah.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:55.000
Carmen Cruickshank: So then excluding that, it might have been, like, $160 cost per lead. Okay, so seeing the past 2 weeks, it's definitely decreasing the cost per lead. That is in the right direction, so I'm glad.

