00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:12.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, that's the thing with Google Ads, though, is it takes a while to kind of almost figure out, like, the right way the landing page is. Also, with Meta, you have the visual aspect of it, so it's kind of conveying a lot more to the person, versus Google, it's a lot more cold. So…

